"""Lecture 35 objective pool A -- Asthma: definition, pathophysiology, course, etiology, types and
triggers (slides 5-42).

KEYS ARE WRITTEN SHORT ON PURPOSE -- detail lives in the explanation.
EXPLANATIONS follow tools/question_writing/EXPLAIN_DEEP.md (Jaxon, 2026-10-29): the key names the decisive
clue and the fact; each wrong choice says why it fails here, the replacing fact, and a tell.

Set 1 is recall against the syllabus objectives, so no stem carries a patient age. Slides are the content
source; the recording only sets emphasis. No epidemiology statistic is keyed ("I'm not going to test you on
epidemiologic statistics"). Scope caps live in cms_e6l35_scope.py.
"""
